{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12725","headline":"郢城西楼吟 · 张继","name":"郢城西楼吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"连山尽塞水萦回，山上戍门临水开。\n珠帘直下一百丈，日暖游鳞自相向。\n昔人爱险闭层城，今人复爱闲江清。\n沙洲枫岸无来客，草绿花开山鸟鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张继","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12725.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12725","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}